# Product Overview

## Problem
Advertising platform for streamers. The frontend consists of several parts. 1. Streamer dashboard: ad display settings, ad selection, balance. 2. Partner dashboard: ad creation, targeting, streamer segmentation, analytics. 3. Widget – OBS web layer for displaying ads in streams.

## Target Users
Streamers and partners/advertisers

## Unique Value
Advertising campaigns and unique formats for streamers.

---

# Technical Context

## Frontend
Vue 3, TypeScript, Vite, Element Plus, Tailwind CSS

## Backend
N/A

## Database
N/A

## Testing
Vitest, Vue Test Utils, jsdom

## Logging & Monitoring
Sentry for error tracking

## Other
Laravel Echo/Pusher for real-time, Firebase for hosting, OBS WebSocket for OBS Studio integration
